          'Designed and developed a fully responsive landing page in Framer to showcase the CreditWise mobile application. Created page layouts, user flows, and conversion-focused sections that highlighted key features, benefits, and calls to action. Leveraged the existing design system to ensure visual consistency across the product ecosystem and implemented animations and interactions to create an engaging user experience.',
